## Intent & Decisions
The user asked to disable Code Mode shortly after 357e256 enabled it: "never mind I don't want it". The agent removed the variable instead of setting it to 0, because off is the default and an absent key is less to maintain.

## Actions & Verification
Staged only the removal hunk through git apply --cached; unrelated uncommitted edits in claude_settings.json and lib/codex.sh stayed out. Confirmed the staged diff was the single removed line. ~/.claude/settings.json is a symlink to claude_settings.json, so the removal applies to new sessions without rerunning the installer.

